  "description": "An impossible crush, a wish to make a difference.\n\nHenry Kim, a 28-year-old private academy teacher, realizes that he has returned to the day he was taking the csat exam. Everything started with a phone call to his best friend Chance, who he had a crush on for ten years.\n\nWhen Henry received an invitation to chance's wedding, he gets drunk out of a depression that he'd lose his best and his crush and speaks his true heart on the phone. \"I wish you never met Lucy...\" \n\nAs if his wish had been answered, Henry travels back in time to the point where Chance and Lucy had not met yet. Now, it's up to Henry to correct his hasty wish and put an end to his long and painful crush.\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
